WebGL / GLSL tester in 2127 bytes (minified).

Compiles and runs glsl shaders. Supports everything that WebGL2 supports.

Requirements:

 * nix OR nodejs

With nix:

    nix build

With nodejs:

    node src/minify.js src/index.html

See additional options on the minifier with

    node src/minify.js --help

If using the minifier in your own project, it dependes on

    * `terser` = 5.51.2
    * `@plutotcool/glsl-bundler` = 1.4.1
